+  ComfyUI-SaveImageWithMetaData with <OUT>/nodes-root on sys.path, as in a real ComfyUI tree
+  (py/defs/__init__.py:13-16 imports the pack again under that exact package name);
+* v2: /pack/v2, read-only.
+"original" adds one harness-only adapter (ADAPTER below); "original-raw" runs the pristine
+pack unmodified and is kept as evidence of the core incompatibility.
+Model-bearing core nodes are replaced, identically on all sides, by stand-ins with real
+INPUT_TYPES/RETURN_TYPES (CLIP stand-ins carry real ComfyUI tokenizer objects), so the saver
+sees the same graph and values without loading weights. Clocks are frozen on all sides.
+"""
