+    # Harness-only adapter (MERVYN m_e131a2d555). The pinned original passes the executor's output
+    # cache to execution.get_input_data (py/capture.py:19-27); core 6257422b calls
+    # execution_list.get_cache(...) on it (execution.py:294), which HierarchicalCache lacks, and its
